+ * Change the line rate on the fly (issue #23 U0-3, LINK_SETBAUD).
+ *
+ * ONLY call this with the link quiescent -- the host guarantees that before it asks, and
+ * the caller must already have finished sending the acknowledgement, because that
+ * acknowledgement necessarily goes out at the OLD rate.  The sequence here is: wait for
+ * the TX FIFO to empty, pause long enough for the last character to leave the shift
